      "comment": "Sets DirectDraw cooperative level and creates the palette for rendering.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Store hWnd parameter to g_hWndDirectDraw global\n    2. Call IDirectDraw::SetCooperativeLevel via vtable offset 0x50 (80)\n       - Flags: 0x11 (DDSCL_FULLSCREEN | DDSCL_EXCLUSIVE)\n    3. On SetCooperativeLevel failure: log error, return 0\n    4. Zero-initialize g_aPaletteEntries array (256 PALETTEENTRY structs)\n    5. Call IDirectDraw::CreatePalette via vtable offset 0x14 (20)\n       - Flags: 4 (DDPCAPS_8BIT)\n       - Stores palette pointer to g_pDirectDraw\n    6. On CreatePalette failure: log error, return 0\n    7. Call InitializeDirectDrawWindow(dwFlags) for final setup\n\n  Parameters:\n    hWnd (ECX)    - Window handle for DirectDraw cooperation\n    dwFlags (EDX) - Display mode flags passed to InitializeDirectDrawWindow\n\n  Returns:\n    EAX - Result from InitializeDirectDrawWindow on success, 0 on failure\n\n  Globals Modified:\n    g_hWndDirectDraw     - Stores hWnd parameter\n    g_aPaletteEntries    - Zero-initialized (256 * 4 = 1024 bytes)\n    g_pDirectDraw        - Receives IDirectDrawPalette pointer\n\n  Error Conditions:\n    - SetCooperativeLevel fails: logs \"SetCooperativeLevel failed!\"\n    - CreatePalette fails: logs \"CreatePalette failed!\"",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
