      "name": "InitializeDirectDrawWindow",
      "signature": "dword InitializeDirectDrawWindow(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Initializes the DirectDraw window and primary surface for rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if DirectDraw is in release mode; return 0 if true\n2. Close any existing DirectDraw window\n3. Validate DirectDraw initialization state and call cleanup if needed\n4. Set screen dimensions: 0x280 (640) x 0x1e0 (480)\n5. Determine color bit depth from bit masks:\n   - Check g_dwColorModeBits against gdwBitMasks offsets\n   - 0x10 bits (16-bit) if gdwBitMasks+4 mask matches\n   - 0x18 bits (24-bit) if gdwBitMasks+8 mask matches\n   - 0x20 bits (32-bit) otherwise\n6. Create DirectDraw surfaces:\n   - Call SetDisplayMode vtable[0x54] on g_pDirectDraw with 0x280x0x1e0\n   - If successful (return 0), zero-initialize 26 DWORDs on stack\n   - Call CreateSurface vtable[0x18] with surface descriptor\n   - Set g_bDirectDrawInitialized and _g_dwDirectDrawWindowClosed flags on success\n7. Log appropriate message (success or failure)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n1 - DirectDraw window and primary surface created successfully\n0 - Failed during SetDisplayMode or CreateSurface; error logged via FUN_6f8e2450\n\nSide Effects:\n- Modifies globals: g_bDirectDrawInitialized, _g_dwDirectDrawWindowClosed\n- Sets display dimensions: g_dwScreenHeight=0x280, g_dwDisplayWidth=0x280, g_dwScreenWidth=0x1e0, g_dwDisplayHeight=0x1e0\n- Creates DirectDraw primary surface: g_pPrimarySurface\n- Queues log messages via QueueLogMessage()\n\nError Handling:\n- SetDisplayMode failure: Selects s_SetDisplayMode_failed_ message, calls FUN_6f8e2450(msg, nResult)\n- CreateSurface failure: Selects s_Failed_to_create_primary_surface_ message, calls FUN_6f8e2450(msg, nResult)\n- Both failures return 0 and queue failure message\n\nStructure Layout (Stack Variables):\nOffset  | Size | Field              | Type       | Description\n--------|------|---------------------|-----------|-------------------\n-0x80   | 4    | dwColorDepth       | uint      | Color bit depth (0x10/0x18/0x20)\n-0x7c   | 112  | ddSurfaceDesc[]    | undefined4 | Surface description array (26 DWORDs)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x280 - Screen width/height dimension (640 pixels)\n0x1e0 - Screen width/height dimension (480 pixels)\n0x10 - 16-bit color depth constant\n0x18 - 24-bit color depth constant\n0x20 - 32-bit color depth constant\n0x54 - VTable offset for SetDisplayMode in DirectDraw interface\n0x18 - VTable offset for CreateSurface in DirectDraw interface\n0x1a - Loop iteration count (26 iterations to zero 104 bytes)\n0x6c - Stack offset value for surface descriptor\n0xffffffff - Cleanup parameter value for FUN_6f8e4f5f",
