      "name": "CloseDirectDrawWindow",
      "signature": "void CloseDirectDrawWindow(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Cleanly shuts down DirectDraw resources and closes the video window.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check if DirectDraw window is active (g_dwDirectDrawWindowActive != 0)\n  2. If inactive, skip shutdown and return early\n  3. Log \"Closing DirectDraw window...\" to message queue\n  4. Loop 3 times: call FUN_6f8e3e70(0) and FUN_6f8e2040() for cleanup\n  5. Release primary surface: check NULL, then call virtual method at offset 0x8\n  6. Release secondary surface: check NULL, then call virtual method at offset 0x8\n  7. Release tertiary surface: check NULL, then call virtual method at offset 0x8\n  8. Call g_pfnDirectDrawRelease(0, 0) via function pointer to cleanup main object\n  9. Clear g_dwDirectDrawWindowActive to 0x0\n  10. Clear g_dwDirectDrawWindowClosed to 0x0\n  11. Log \"... DirectDraw window closed.\" to message queue\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  None (void)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
