      "name": "UnlockRenderSurface",
      "signature": "dword UnlockRenderSurface(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Unlocks the render surface and releases DirectDraw resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call render surface unlock method (virtual function at offset 0x80)\n  2. If unlock fails, log error message and return failure (0)\n  3. Clear render surface locked flag (g_dwRenderSurfaceLocked = 0)\n  4. Release DirectDraw resources via release function pointer\n  5. Leave DirectDraw critical section (creating if necessary)\n  6. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  1 on success (surface unlocked)\n  0 on failure (unlock operation failed)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
